        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions FII-3440  Contemporary Flush Door Pull.</b>\r\n<p>\r\nFor over 10 years, First Impressions has been designing and manufacturing beautiful custom decor for homes, right here is the U.S.A. They offer some of the most diverse and beautiful door handle styles we carry.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMake an up-to-date decor statement with these large ultra contemporary flush door handles!   \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis large <b>Contemporary Style</b> flush door pull can be used in many applications such as:\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Sliding and Pocket Doors</li>\r\n<li>Metal framed glass doors, such as on Showers</li>\r\n<li>Just about anywhere a flush door pull is needed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis flush door pull  is available in 2 great contemporary finishes, Polished Chrome and Satin Nickel. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions FII-3440/300  Contemporary  Flush  Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11-13/16\" (300 MM)</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Opening Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 6-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width:  2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Non Rusting Aluminum</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
